      "cooked": "<p>When playing Agent of Gloomweaver /Broken Vessle Spite, does Spite still take 5 damage per person in the safe house when he flips.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Me and my brother were not sure because safe house says \"Flips to drug wrecked monstrosity\" which might mean promos which flip to something else do not take the damage, or on the other hand we might be overthinking things / expecting GTG to over think things and safe house could just as easily read \"when Spite flips...\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What &nbsp;are your guys thoughts?</p>",
